maybe you should not sign off until bugs are fixed? But \"A confirmed report is logged; no new build is installed. Keep testing the same build.\" So bugs remain in this build. The instruction: \"When you believe the areas above have no remaining bugs, call sign_off.\" Since we found confirmed bugs, technically we shouldn't sign off? But the session must en", "truncated": true}
